  "description": "R3-05 independent-review FP (m2-r5 kernel): a 1-hop webhook delivery whose only denied control is a 403 (not 401) and whose signature rides in a non-legacy header (`webhook-signature`) carries no in-DAG secret provenance (no second hop, no verified causal edge, no derived_crypto_binding). evaluateForgedWebhookProvenanceGuard must fail it closed regardless of the denied-control status in {401,403,404} or the signature-carrier name; the pre-fix guard keyed on 401 + a fixed header list and let this variant confirm. Also covers (reviewer fix) the zero-delta readback guard running before the stub filter so a stub-shaped session readback cannot skip it.",
